{"candidateAnswer":"Journal and creative writing","evidence":"[D6:4 | 4:09 pm on 13 August, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan. Your support means a lot to me. It's tough staying positive, but knowing I have people like you in my corner makes it easier.\n[D11:7 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan, that sounds like a fun and unexpected event! It's always interesting how helping someone can turn into a little adventure of its own. And how's your watercolor painting going?","itemId":"urn:uuid:230e6db7-66a4-5e83-81ea-86ccf2361dc7","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:456b5640542fa5a8dbf01cf349302ec7a68ebf7ff62c6d9c8bccdece99f0e8fe","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of writing does Sam do to relax and cope with his health issues?","referenceAnswer":"journalling, creative writing","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"456b5640542fa5a8dbf01cf349302ec7a68ebf7ff62c6d9c8bccdece99f0e8fe"}}]}